"> <div class="field__item"><a href="https://www.culturalsurvival.org/country/global" hreflang="en">Global</a></div> </div> </div> <span><span>agnes</span></span> <span><time datetime="2026-07-21T12:36:01-04:00" title="Tuesday, July 21, 2026 - 12:36">Tue, 07/21/2026 - 12:36</time> </span> <div class="field field--name-taxonomy-vocabulary-14 field--type-entity-reference field--label-above"> <div class="field__label">Issues</div> <div class="field__items "> <div class="field__item"><a href="https://www.culturalsurvival.org/issues/languages-and-cultures" hreflang="en">Languages and Cultures</a></div> </div> </div> <div class="field field--name-field-program field--type-list-string field--label-inline clearfix"> <div class="field__label d-inline-block">Program</div> <div class="field__items d-inline-block"> <div class="field__item">5</div> </div> </div> <div class="field field--name-field-image-item field--type-image field--label-above"> <div class="field__label">Main Image</div> <div class="field__items "> <div class="field__item"> <img loading="eager" srcset="https://www.culturalsurvival.org/sites/default/files/styles/max_325x325/public/Copy%20of%20Convocatoria%20MC%20espa%C3%B1ol%20%281%29.png?itok=4UmZoVLI 325w, https://www.culturalsurvival.org/sites/default/files/styles/max_650x650/public/Copy%20of%20Convocatoria%20MC%20espa%C3%B1ol%20%281%29.png?itok=wXpM9WHW 650w, https://www.culturalsurvival.org/sites/default/files/styles/max_1300x1300/public/Copy%20of%20Convocatoria%20MC%20espa%C3%B1ol%20%281%29.png?itok=Sdvf7moH 1300w, https://www.culturalsurvival.org/sites/default/files/styles/max_1920x1920/public/Copy%20of%20Convocatoria%20MC%20espa%C3%B1ol%20%281%29.png?itok=WaT_lNvC 1920w, https://www.culturalsurvival.org/sites/default/files/styles/max_2600x2600/public/Copy%20of%20Convocatoria%20MC%20espa%C3%B1ol%20%281%29.png?itok=8nRGnzDo 2000w" sizes="(min-width: 1290px) 1290px, 100vw" src="https://www.culturalsurvival.org/sites/default/files/styles/max_325x325/public/Copy%20of%20Convocatoria%20MC%20espa%C3%B1ol%20%281%29.png?itok=4UmZoVLI" alt class="img-responsive"> </div> </div> </div> <div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p><strong>Application Deadline:&nbsp; August 9, 2026</strong><br> &nbsp;</p> <p><strong>The Indigenous Community Media Fund</strong> (ICMF) is part of Cultural Survivalâ€™s Community Media Program. This fund was created to support initiatives by Indigenous organizations, collectives, and media outlets that contribute to strengthening their right to freedom of expression and access to information. Through these initiatives, we promote community awareness and organization around their worldviews, the defense of their rights, and their relationship with their territories.</p> <p dir="ltr"><br> <strong>Who is eligible?</strong></p> <ul dir="ltr"> <li role="presentation">Indigenous community radio stations</li> <li role="presentation">Networks of Indigenous community radio stations or media</li> <li role="presentation">Networks or collectives of Indigenous communicators</li> <li role="presentation">Networks or collectives of Indigenous women communicators</li> <li role="presentation">&nbsp;Networks or collectives of young communicators and Indigenous 2SLGBTQ+ community members</li> <li role="presentation">Collectives of Indigenous muralists and photographers</li> <li role="presentation">Other media outlets managed by Indigenous peoples: print media, community television, audiovisual and multimedia production, social media, intranet, and community internet.</li> </ul> <p dir="ltr">&nbsp;<br> <strong>Which regions and countries are eligible?</strong></p> <ul dir="ltr"> <li role="presentation">Africa: Botswana, Cameroon, Democratic Republic of the Congo, Kenya, Namibia, South Africa, Tanzania, Uganda</li> <li role="presentation">Asia: Philippines, Indonesia, Nepal</li> <li role="presentation">Central America, South America, and the Caribbean: Argentina, Bolivia, Belize, Brazil, Chile, Colombia, Costa Rica, El Salvador, Ecuador, Guatemala, Guyana, Honduras, Panama, Paraguay, Peru, and Suriname</li> <li role="presentation">North America: Canada, the United States, and Mexico</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p dir="ltr"><strong>How to apply?</strong></p> <p dir="ltr">Proposals must be submitted through<a href="https://culturalsurvival.grantplatform.com/"> Cultural Survivalâ€™s</a> application platform. Interested organizations, collectives, and groups must create an account (or log in if they already have one), complete the form for the 2027 Call for Proposals â€“ Indigenous Community Media Fund, and submit their application by the deadline: <strong>August 9, 2026</strong>.</p> <p dir="ltr">Instructions for registration and proposal submission are available in<a href="https://www.culturalsurvival.org/sites/default/files/Call%20for%20Proposal%202027%20-%20Indigenous%20Community%20Media%20%28%20English%29%20%281%29.pdf"> the call for proposals guidelines.</a></p> <p dir="ltr"><br> <strong>What types of initiatives are eligible?</strong></p> <p dir="ltr">Cultural Survivalâ€™s Indigenous Community Media Fund will prioritize, though not exclusively, Indigenous communication initiatives that contribute to environmental justice and the response to climate change. Additionally, proposals led by women, youth, and members of the 2SLGBTQ+ community will be given special consideration.</p> <p dir="ltr">The following eligible initiatives are presented as guidelines and examples of approaches that can strengthen proposals:</p> <ol> <li dir="ltr"> <p dir="ltr" role="presentation">Access to and advocacy for Indigenous media</p> </li> <li dir="ltr"> <p dir="ltr" role="presentation">Strengthening Indigenous media and technological infrastructure</p> </li> <li dir="ltr"> <p dir="ltr" role="presentation">Capacity building in communication and digital technologies</p> </li> <li dir="ltr"> <p dir="ltr" role="presentation">Content production and dissemination</p> </li> <li dir="ltr"> <p dir="ltr" role="presentation">Exchange of experiences and strengthening of networks</p> </li> </ol> <p dir="ltr">Projects will be evaluated based on their relevance to addressing the needs and priorities of Indigenous peoples and territories, their organization and feasibility, Indigenous leadership, the participation of women, youth, and 2SLGBTQ+ Indigenous people, and their contribution to strengthening media, languages, knowledge, and Indigenous forms of communication.</p> <p dir="ltr"><br> <strong>Important Dates</strong></p> <ul> <li>Call for Proposals Launch July 21, 2026</li> <li>Application Period &nbsp;July 21â€“August 9, 2026</li> <li>Call for Applications <strong>Deadline&nbsp; August 9, 2026</strong>, at 11:59 p.m. (EST)</li> <li>Interviews with shortlisted candidates&nbsp; November 2026</li> <li>Notification of selected candidates Starting December 15, 2026</li> <li>Award phase&nbsp; &nbsp;January and February 2027</li> <li>Project implementation &nbsp; March through October 2027</li> </ul> <p dir="ltr"><br> If you have questions about the call for proposals or encounter technical issues submitting your proposal, please contact us at&nbsp;<a href="radio@culturalsurvival.org">radio@culturalsurvival.org</a></p> <p dir="ltr">&nbsp;</p> <p dir="ltr"><a href="https://www.culturalsurvival.org/sites/default/files/Call%20for%20Proposal%202027%20-%20Indigenous%20Community%20Media%20%28%20English%29%20%281%29.pdf">APPLICATION GUIDELINES</a></p> <p dir="ltr"><strong>Thank you for your interest in applying!</strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> <div class="field field--name-field-related-cs-program field--type-entity-reference field--label-above"> <div class="field__label">Related CS Program</div> <div class="field__items "> <div class="field__item"><a href="https://www.culturalsurvival.org/taxonomy/term/3460" hreflang="en">Community Media</a></div> <div class="field__item"><a href="https://www.culturalsurvival.org/taxonomy/term/3558" hreflang="en">Current Opportunities</a></div> </div> </div>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HN-8-EMfih5WxIoz4lqkB5xOnS1gNmbdvBUkeHo6UTMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx?2027 Call for Proposals for the Indigenous Community Media Fundƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;s99lVmiIYYcNgAUW53rRJST7YgOd_EGGmfF0fPGs_jQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;KqGicQCiySsM-OsCKbbB3NPJNiArpDf45ENWqNoZv8Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxYhttps://www.culturalsurvival.org/news/2027-call-proposals-indigenous-community-media-fundƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HzYSyjJ2h8ds2QbJSoJfn1FUiSwDyv9tyaRj8VEmfYIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx?2027-call-for-proposals-for-the-indigenous-community-media-fundƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;iWkWOjwzNAqZzp1iCpNo5rT3OgHOBtZeEtPgIS4tWiUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;FR1SGCyW772Kwv6rghLBr4Yn9PzYDeVI7WK5iRl8Rsgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkndecolonizationƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;oKATDogcnqHzdwHzXOgWTPzz4x2WWUs4oeqUXX0nryIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;I7gK9TETBJPzLhEB9tQKzhiPkluMlXC9m0qFTNygdCgƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nas6jnklP-yA3ElyLC19h6O57URtVJd2LRo9X0dehSEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:/